+  //   software-decode fallback for video — that is the whole point of this build
+  //   (zero forced software decode; the CPU must never be tricked into decoding
+  //   video the HD 4000 ASIC can do in hardware).
+  //
+  //   This strict policy is SAFE on the target because VA-API H.264 hardware
+  //   decode is verified present: `vainfo` reports the i965 (Ivy Bridge) driver
